            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The inferior vena cava filter clinical environment is notable for the degree of controversy, uncertainty, and fear associated with these devices by both physicians and the public. This article reviews some of the more important current issues with these devices as well as emerging and future trends.</AbstractText>
